Package: mcp-is
Version: 0.2.2
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: docker.io, docker-compose-v2, adduser
Maintainer: MCP IS Team
Description: MCP server for InSales e-commerce platform
 Model Context Protocol server that integrates AI agents with
 the InSales e-commerce platform via REST API.
 Supports products, orders, clients, categories, collections,
 images, metafields, webhooks and system info.
